% Ascent at double speed, straight as an arrow over a driving sixteenth bass; Spark climbs a step a bar.
% mode E aeolian, progression drive, form intro(2) A(4) B(4) A2(4) turn(2)
% A=ascent_dim B=spark_seq counter=None
